# EFNU Fuel API — Monthly Statistics
# GET /api/v1/stats/monthly
#
# Returns fueling totals per month and fuel type for a given year.
#
# Optional parameters:
#   year   Year (defaults to current year)

@baseUrl = https://efnu.fi/fueldev/club/api/v1
@apiKey = YOUR_API_KEY_HERE

### Get monthly stats for the current year
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Get monthly stats for a specific year
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/monthly?year=2025
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
